    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cave Path is a mining adventure where you explore caves to collect precious ores, all while battling enemies and a constant drain on your health. Once your health runs out, you\u2019re sent back to the surface with whatever loot you\u2019ve gathered. Use your earnings to upgrade your skills and gear, then dive back in for even bigger rewards!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mining and Bombs:</strong> Break through blocks using your pickaxe or bombs to gather valuable resources like silver, gold, diamonds, and rubies. Going deeper leads to better ore\u2014but also tougher challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424130/extras/4ddb878237fa76b04907fb6db61317f3.poster.avif?t=1745372015\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424130/extras/4ddb878237fa76b04907fb6db61317f3.webm?t=1745372015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424130/extras/4ddb878237fa76b04907fb6db61317f3.mp4?t=1745372015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beware of Darkness:</strong> Place candles to prevent monsters from spawning in dark areas. If they do appear, fend them off with your shotgun\u2014just remember your ammo is limited.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skill Upgrades:</strong> Unlock powerful perks such as Instakill (a chance to defeat enemies instantly), Extra Miner (summon a helping hand), and Damage Resist (take less damage over time). Customize your character to match your play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424130/extras/4eb84692f2b2b030f5b7cb194165c67c.poster.avif?t=1745372015\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424130/extras/4eb84692f2b2b030f5b7cb194165c67c.webm?t=1745372015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424130/extras/4eb84692f2b2b030f5b7cb194165c67c.mp4?t=1745372015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High Risk, High Reward:</strong> Deeper caves mean stronger foes and harsher conditions, but also bigger profits. How far will you push your luck before it\u2019s time to head back?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the challenge, uncover hidden riches, and see how deep you can go in <strong>Cave Path</strong>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cave Path is a mining adventure where you explore caves to collect precious ores, all while battling enemies and a constant drain on your health. Once your health runs out, you\u2019re sent back to the surface with whatever loot you\u2019ve gathered. Use your earnings to upgrade your skills and gear, then dive back in for even bigger rewards!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mining and Bombs:</strong> Break through blocks using your pickaxe or bombs to gather valuable resources like silver, gold, diamonds, and rubies. Going deeper leads to better ore\u2014but also tougher challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424130/extras/4ddb878237fa76b04907fb6db61317f3.poster.avif?t=1745372015\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424130/extras/4ddb878237fa76b04907fb6db61317f3.webm?t=1745372015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424130/extras/4ddb878237fa76b04907fb6db61317f3.mp4?t=1745372015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beware of Darkness:</strong> Place candles to prevent monsters from spawning in dark areas. If they do appear, fend them off with your shotgun\u2014just remember your ammo is limited.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skill Upgrades:</strong> Unlock powerful perks such as Instakill (a chance to defeat enemies instantly), Extra Miner (summon a helping hand), and Damage Resist (take less damage over time). Customize your character to match your play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424130/extras/4eb84692f2b2b030f5b7cb194165c67c.poster.avif?t=1745372015\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424130/extras/4eb84692f2b2b030f5b7cb194165c67c.webm?t=1745372015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424130/extras/4eb84692f2b2b030f5b7cb194165c67c.mp4?t=1745372015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High Risk, High Reward:</strong> Deeper caves mean stronger foes and harsher conditions, but also bigger profits. How far will you push your luck before it\u2019s time to head back?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the challenge, uncover hidden riches, and see how deep you can go in <strong>Cave Path</strong>!</p>",
